---

<BaseLayout
  title="Builder: When God Confirms the Calling - Caleb McGennis"
  description="The story of wrestling with doubt, drawing a compass on a sticky note, and hearing the exact words I needed at the exact moment I needed them. Some of you are builders."
  type="article"
  publishedTime="2026-03-04"
  author="Caleb Michael McGennis"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-soho-white py-20 md:py-32 px-4 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <a href="/blog/entrepreneur-ai" class="inline-flex items-center text-mcgennis-navy hover:text-mcgennis-gold transition-colors mb-8">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to An Entrepreneur in a World of AI
      </a>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-display font-bold mb-8 text-gray-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">
        Builder
      </h1>
      <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-brass-horizontal rounded-full shadow-sm mb-8"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-gray-500">
          <span>By Caleb Michael McGennis</span>
          <span>&bull;</span>
          <time datetime="2026-03-04">March 4, 2026</time>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://themcgennisfamily.com/blog/entrepreneur-ai/builder" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 bg-mcgennis-navy hover:bg-opacity-90 text-white rounded-lg transition-all text-xs font-medium shadow-sm hover:shadow-md" aria-label="Share on Facebook">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="hidden sm:inline">Share</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https://themcgennisfamily.com/blog/entrepreneur-ai/builder&text=Builder%3A%20When%20God%20Confirms%20the%20Calling" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 bg-mcgennis-maroon hover:bg-opacity-90 text-white rounded-lg transition-all text-xs font-medium shadow-sm hover:shadow-md" aria-label="Share on Twitter">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M23.953 4.57a10 10 0 01-2.825.775 4.958 4.958 0 002.163-2.723c-.951.555-2.005.959-3.127 1.184a4.92 4.92 0 00-8.384 4.482C7.69 8.095 4.067 6.13 1.64 3.162a4.822 4.822 0 00-.666 2.475c0 1.71.87 3.213 2.188 4.096a4.904 4.904 0 01-2.228-.616v.06a4.923 4.923 0 003.946 4.827 4.996 4.996 0 01-2.212.085 4.936 4.936 0 004.604 3.417a9.867 9.867 0 01-6.102 2.105c-.39 0-.779-.023-1.17-.067a13.995 13.995 0 007.557 2.209c9.053 0 13.998-7.496 13.998-13.985 0-.21 0-.42-.015-.63A9.935 9.935 0 0024 4.59z"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="hidden sm:inline">Tweet</span>
          </a>
          <button onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(window.location.href); alert('Link copied to clipboard!');" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-700 text-white rounded-lg transition-all text-xs font-medium shadow-sm hover:shadow-md" aria-label="Copy link">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
            </svg>
